markdown/platform-security/platform-encryption/understanding-kmf.md","line":34},{"title":"One of the core features of KMF is to provide the capability  to manage  keys, such as revoking or rotating keys.  KMF properly secures sensitive data with the most up-to-date encryption materials and life cycle operations.","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/platform-encryption/key-management-actions.md","line":44},{"title":"Database Encryption","target":"db-full-disk-encryption","line":53},{"title":"Field Encryption Enterprise","target":"now-platform-encryption","line":53},{"title":"Field Encryption","target":"field-encryption","line":55},{"title":"Encryption and Key Management subscription bundle","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/platform-encryption/encryption-sku.md","line":55},{"title":"Exploring the Key Management Framework","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/platform-encryption/explore-kmf.md","line":59},{"title":"Configuring the Key Management Framework","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/platform-encryption/configure-kmf.md","line":61},{"title":"Key Management Framework Reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/platform-encryption/understanding-kmf.md","line":63},{"title":"Key management actions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/platform-encryption/key-management-actions.md","line":65},{"title":"Import a key from a web service","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/platform-encryption/import-key-webservice-1.md","line":67},{"title":"import a key from a web service","tar